WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.579
The student’s prepared answers, pasted into the lesson doc

2
00:00:02.579 --> 00:00:06.548
A missing word? Type [the and press Tab to insert it in Ringle orange

3
00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:11.220
Select a phrase and press ⌘/Ctrl 3 to highlight it

4
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:17.235
Asking a follow-up? Type * first and press Enter to bold the whole line

5
00:00:17.235 --> 00:00:22.159
A mistake as they speak? Type -word, press Tab, type the fix, press Tab

6
00:00:22.159 --> 00:00:30.501
Quotation marks close themselves, and Tab jumps past the closing one
